# Testing and evidence

Put tests in the proper subsystem, not only `tests/evals`. A skipped test is not PASS. Do not change expected outputs to force green. Record command, cwd, UTC, exit code, counts, duration, and whether the test is mocked, local-runtime, or external-read-only.

Current local runtime proof is required for runtime claims. Historical `reports/latest/` is not current.
